  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">plickers. 라는앱이 있는데요<br><br>신기합니다. <br><br>전다음단원상호평가위해<br><br>애들과 연습?훈련중.ㅋ<br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/216CB84F55FC91563B\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">앱이구요<br>선생님만 설치하시면되요.학생들은자기번호의 카드가있고.<br>드는방향에따라 A.B.C D를 선택할수있고<br>저마다모양도 다다르고<br>작게써있어서<br>공개적으로들지만.뭘들었는지 알수없어요.<br>저마다의 QR코드비슷해요<br><br>저는<br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/217B724F55FC915702\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">욜케. 코팅해서 뒤에번호붙여 링꽂아뒀어요.<br><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/246CC04F55FC91583C\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">1.2.3번카드구요.흐려서안보이는데.<br>테두리에 번호와 방향에따라ABCD있어요.<br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21768B5055FC915936\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2302AB4855FC915A05\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2477A64855FC915C0B\" class=\"txc-image\"></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">왼쪽위에명렬은.제가등록해둔 울반번호.<br>카드읽히면색변하고<br>카드밑에흰네모는 읽을때뜨는네모</p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">오른쪽위는 집계.<br><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vcb5d8y8iBB8tjTiE44ynOB\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vcb5d8y8iBB8tjTiE44ynOB?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZjYjVkOHk4aUJCOHRqVGlFNDR5bk9CIiwidGlkIjoiNjFiMTUxN2MtZDJkZi00MDU1LWI1NzgtMTI0YWIyZDIwODc2IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgxNzMyfQ.73DiRmfzjGN9-VV8zCmsOgXxcmTsqvl68vRZ7PfprJq8ZAcp-R9V9vJlZRQkdHTTS85-gTglGbmugnCrro_MoA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">일캐읽힘.<br><br>근데애들이비스듬하거나 흔들고있어서.28명중.<br>5ㅡ6명은안읽히는데..<br>전20명넘으면 패스해요.ㅎ<br>글고웹에서 기능더사용할수있구요.<br>아이들도즐거위해요<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
